-- src:319: within 15 days of becoming aware. Aware on 10 May 2026: the last day is 25 May.
#ASSERT `the last day to record the information in the register within s 21.1(3)` (YMD 2026 5 10) EQUALS YMD 2026 5 25
#ASSERT `the corporation recorded the information in time within s 21.1(3)` (YMD 2026 5 10) (YMD 2026 5 25)
#ASSERT `the corporation recorded the information in time within s 21.1(3)` (YMD 2026 5 10) (YMD 2026 5 10)
