-- src:390
#ASSERT `the corporation is guilty of an offence within s 21.31(5)` TRUE FALSE
#ASSERT NOT (`the corporation is guilty of an offence within s 21.31(5)` TRUE TRUE)
#ASSERT (`the most a court may impose on summary conviction within s 21.31(5)`)'s `maximum fine in dollars` EQUALS 100000

GIVEN a IS A BOOLEAN
      b IS A BOOLEAN
      c IS A BOOLEAN
      d IS A BOOLEAN
      e IS A BOOLEAN
      f IS A BOOLEAN
      g IS A BOOLEAN
      h IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A `Record kept by an investigative body of a request (s 21.32(1))`
`a record` a b c d e f g h MEANS
    `Record kept by an investigative body of a request (s 21.32(1))` WITH
        `it sets out the name of the corporation that was the subject of the request` IS a
        `it sets out the reasonable grounds on which the request was based` IS b
        `it sets out information respecting what was requested` IS c
        `it sets out the date the request was served or deemed to have been received` IS d
        `it sets out information respecting the service or the sending of the request` IS e
        `it sets out all information received from the corporation in response to the request` IS f
        `there is prescribed information` IS g
        `it sets out the prescribed information` IS h

